WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.080
- Well, speaking of
wigs, you brought it up.

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:04.033
The book has this picture of you,

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.856
which is fantastic!

00:00:06.856 --> 00:00:07.760
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:08.790
So what's going on here?

00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:11.048
And how many drugs were you on?

00:00:11.048 --> 00:00:12.413
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:12.413 --> 00:00:16.450
- Well, that was taken, (laughs)

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:18.056
- I mean, it looks awesome

00:00:18.056 --> 00:00:21.300
- That was taken after
we wrapped the series,

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.730
after our very last scene doing the show

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:28.330
which was outside of the Rosebud Motel.

00:00:28.330 --> 00:00:33.330
And we finished, we popped some champagne

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:39.888
and I was feeling rather merry

00:00:39.888 --> 00:00:41.350
(kelly laughing)

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:43.870
and one of Moira's wigs

00:00:43.870 --> 00:00:46.790
was being kinda of passed around

00:00:46.790 --> 00:00:49.210
one of the trailers at that point.

00:00:49.210 --> 00:00:50.870
And we were all kind of, you know,

00:00:50.870 --> 00:00:52.890
in there together telling stories

00:00:52.890 --> 00:00:57.350
and congratulating each other
and crying and saying goodbye.

00:00:57.350 --> 00:01:00.100
And somebody put the wig on me

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:05.100
and it felt so good.
- Then captured it.

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:07.200
I do feel like you should
have an English accent

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.429
and you should be stoned.

00:01:08.429 --> 00:01:10.319
(both laugh)

00:01:10.319 --> 00:01:12.787
I think it would be a really
great character for something.

